{
  "schema": "zizpanel.app/v1",
  "id": "rabbitmq",
  "name": "RabbitMQ（消息队列）",
  "icon": "🐰",
  "summary": "AMQP 消息队列服务，自带管理界面",
  "notes": [
    "面板安装时会给它写一份最小配置，把 AMQP 监听开到所有网卡：RabbitMQ 4.x 默认只绑 127.0.0.1:5672，别的机器连不上（本机真机实测过：加与不加这行，绑定从 127.0.0.1:5672 变成 *:5672）。",
    "管理界面在 15672（默认账号 guest 只允许本机登录）。要从别的机器用，先在本机执行：rabbitmqctl add_user 用户名 口令，再 rabbitmqctl set_permissions -p / 用户名 \".*\" \".*\" \".*\" —— 面板不替你建用户。",
    "它是 Erlang 应用，装完占几百 MB；不用了就在面板里卸载。"
  ],
  "source": {
    "kind": "brew",
    "formula": "rabbitmq",
    "checksum": "sha256"
  },
  "run": {
    "mode": "brew-service"
  },
  "config": {
    "path": "{brew}/etc/rabbitmq/rabbitmq.conf",
    "format": "kv",
    "if_missing": "create",
    "mode": "0644",
    "own": "user",
    "set": {
      "listeners.tcp.default": "5672"
    }
  },
  "expose": {
    "port": 15672,
    "bind": "0.0.0.0",
    "ui": "app",
    "path": "/"
  },
  "verify": {
    "any_of": [
      {
        "kind": "http",
        "path": "/",
        "timeout": "150s"
      }
    ]
  },
  "health": {
    "kind": "http",
    "path": "/",
    "interval": "30s"
  },
  "uninstall": {
    "always": [
      "/Library/LaunchDaemons/homebrew.mxcl.rabbitmq.plist"
    ],
    "optional_data": [
      "{brew}/var/lib/rabbitmq",
      "{brew}/etc/rabbitmq"
    ],
    "formula": "rabbitmq",
    "keep_note": "默认保留队列数据与配置（{brew}/var/lib/rabbitmq、{brew}/etc/rabbitmq）；勾选「删除数据」才会删 —— 队列里的消息都在里面。"
  },
  "update": {
    "kind": "brew"
  },
  "requires": {
    "system_daemon": true,
    "ports": [
      15672,
      5672
    ]
  }
}
